  (features/driving/components/drivetrain-health/ThermalLoadPanel.tsx) plus the four
  sensor-label keys the parent Drivetrain Health page feeds into the panel's
  `sensors`. The second group backs the native chrome: the P4 leaf freshness /
  loading / empty / error copy, so the Swift sources hold no English prose.
*/

